            "review_title": "Review at Wangheniu",
            "review_text": "Nomad08961508866\n2 contributions\n0\nDelicious Teochew beef hotpot\nMay 2024 • Friends\nThe staff is cute, the beef bone stew hotpot tastes delicious and the Chaozhou hotpot tastes spicy and delicious. I heard the staff say that the cows were raised and slaughtered themselves so the meat was soft and ok. \nThis District 1 branch is a bit crowded, so book in advance to avoid a long wait\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 23, 2024",
